      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In this paper, the idea of lacunary [Formula: see text]-statistical convergent sequence spaces is discussed which is defined by a Musielak-Orlicz function. We study relations between lacunary [Formula: see text]-statistical convergence with lacunary [Formula: see text]-summable sequences. Moreover, we study the [Formula: see text]-lacunary statistical convergence in probabilistic normed space and discuss some topological properties."},
